---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Guided Workshop with Sue | Knit by Machine";
const description = "A hands-on, personal workshop designed to help you make real progress on a project you’re excited about—at a pace that feels focused and doable.";
---

<BaseLayout {title} {description}>
  <main class="page page--guided-workshop">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="section section--hero">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <div class="grid grid--two hero-grid">
          <div class="hero-left">
            <div class="hero-header">
              <div class="hero-title-row">
                <img src="/images/guided_workshops.svg" alt="Guided Workshops logo" class="hero-logo" />
                <h1 data-testid="text-page-title">Guided Workshop with Sue</h1>
              </div>
              <p class="hero-subtitle">
                A 10-day, call-free workshop where you finish one real project on your machine — with focused, written guidance at each step.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-right">
            <div class="hero-media">
              <img src="/images/knit-by-machine-sue.png" alt="Sue at her knitting machine, ready to guide you" class="hero-image" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Full-width intro text -->
        <div class="hero-intro-text">
          <p>
            A 10-day workshop where you bring the project, and I help you move it forward with clear written guidance and short video replies. No calls, no time zones — just steady, practical support as you knit.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Centered CTA -->
        <div class="hero-cta hero-cta--centered">
          <a
            class="button button--primary button--large"
            href="https://knitbymachinecom.outseta.com/auth?widgetMode=register&planUid=ZmNe52W2&planPaymentTerm=oneTime&skipPlanOptions=true#o-anonymous"
            data-testid="button-cta-hero"
          >
            Apply for Your Guided Workshop
          </a>
          <p class="cta-note"><em>You won't pay yet — Sue reviews your project first and sends a custom quote.</em></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <!-- What a Guided Workshop really is -->
    <section class="section section--overview">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2>What a Guided Workshop really is</h2>
        <p>
         A Guided Workshop gives you 10 days of focused support on
<strong>one project you care about right now</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          You bring the project, your machine, and your questions.
          I bring experience, clear next steps, and steady support
          so you don't have to figure it all out alone.
        </p>
        <p>
          We'll stay in touch with a mix of 
          <strong>written messages, text messages</strong> (if you want), <strong>voice notes, and short videos</strong>—whatever makes it easiest for you to keep moving.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <!-- Two-column: What we can work on together + What you get -->
    <section class="section gw-two-col">
      <div class="gw-col">
        <h2>What we can work on together</h2>
        <p>
          Your project can be simple, messy, or somewhere in between. 
          A Guided Workshop is especially helpful if you want support with:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Getting started on a project you've been thinking about for too long</li>
          <li>Moving again on something that's been sitting half-finished</li>
          <li>Sorting out shaping, fit, or construction details</li>
          <li>Translating a pattern to your machine</li>
          <li>Making confident yarn and gauge decisions</li>
          <li>Working through "this part doesn't look right and I don't know why"</li>
          <li>Finishing details so your project looks and feels the way you hoped</li>
        </ul>
    
      </div>

      <div class="gw-col">
        <h2>What you get during your 10 days</h2>
        <p>
          Everything is built around your project, but each Guided Workshop includes:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>10 days of focused support</strong> on one project</li>
          <li><strong>Written, voice, and short video replies</strong> from me</li>
          <li><strong>Clear, "doable" next steps</strong> instead of long lectures</li>
          <li><strong>Feedback for your specific machine, yarn, and pattern</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Gentle accountability</strong> so you don't drift away from your project</li>
          <li><strong>A simple plan for what to do next</strong> once our 10 days are done</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          You keep knitting at your pace. I'm in the background when you need support.
        </p>
      </div>
    
    </section>
<p>
  If you're not sure whether your idea fits, that's exactly what the application is for.
</p>
    <!-- Centered CTA -->
    <div class="hero-cta hero-cta--centered">
      <a
        class="button button--primary button--large"
        href="https://knitbymachinecom.outseta.com/auth?widgetMode=register&planUid=ZmNe52W2&planPaymentTerm=oneTime&skipPlanOptions=true#o-anonymous"
        data-testid="button-cta-mid"
      >
        Apply for Your Guided Workshop
      </a>
      <p class="cta-note"><em>You won't pay yet — Sue reviews your project first and sends a custom quote.</em></p>
    </div>
    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <!-- How it works -->
    <section class="section section--how-it-works">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2>How it works</h2>
        <ol class="steps-list">
          <li>
            <h3>Tell me about your project</h3>
            <p>
              Tell me what you have in mind, your machine, your experience and where you'd like support. 
              This helps me understand the scope before either of us commits.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>I review your project</h3>
            <p>
              I'll look at what you've shared and confirm whether it’s a good fit for a 10-day workshop.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>You receive a custom quote</h3>
            <p>
              Pricing is based on project complexity. 
              <strong>Workshops start at $297</strong>, and you'll see your exact price before you pay.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>You choose your start date</h3>
            <p>
              Once you accept the quote and complete payment, we set your 10-day window and get started.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="kbm-note">
            <h3>You don't need to check in every day</h3>
            <p>
              You choose your pace during your 10-day workshop. Check in when it makes sense for you, and Sue will be there with your next step.
            </p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <!-- Is a Guided Workshop right for you?
    <section class="section section--fit">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2>Is a Guided Workshop right for you?</h2>

        <div class="grid grid--two">
          <div>
            <h3>This is likely a good fit if you:</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Have one project you'd really like to move forward</li>
              <li>Prefer messaging, voice, and short videos over scheduling live calls</li>
              <li>Want specific guidance, not a big course or library</li>
              <li>Are willing to take small actions during the 10 days</li>
              <li>Appreciate honest, kind feedback grounded in real machine-knitting practice</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>It's probably not a fit if you:</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Want a full pattern designed from scratch</li>
              <li>Have a very large, open-ended, or long-term project</li>
              <li>Prefer live, real-time coaching calls</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>
          If your project isn't a good match, I'll let you know before you're asked to pay.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
-->
   

    <!-- Pricing at a glance -->
    <section class="section section--pricing" id="pricing">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2>Pricing at a glance</h2>
        <p>
          Guided Workshops <strong>start at $297</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Your final price depends on the complexity of the project you describe in your application—things like:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>How many parts are involved</li>
          <li>How many moving pieces there are</li>
          <li>How much we'll realistically cover in 10 days</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          You'll always see your <strong>personalized quote before payment</strong>, so there are no surprises.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <!-- Final CTA -->
    <section class="section section--cta gw-cta" id="guided-workshop-application">
      <div class="section-inner section-inner--center">
        <h2>Ready to get started?</h2>
        <p>
          If you're feeling a tug toward one particular project and you'd like a structured 
          10 days with support along the way, fill out the short application and we'll see if it's a fit.
        </p>
        <a 
          class="button button--primary button--large" 
          href="https://knitbymachinecom.outseta.com/auth?widgetMode=register&planUid=ZmNe52W2&planPaymentTerm=oneTime&skipPlanOptions=true#o-anonymous"
          data-testid="button-cta-apply"
        >
          Apply for Your Guided Workshop
        </a>
        <p class="cta-note"><em>You won't pay yet — Sue reviews your project first and sends a custom quote.</em></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page--guided-workshop {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .section-inner {
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .section-inner--center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Hero Section */
  .section--hero {
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Overview Section */
  .section--overview {
    background: #f9fdf5;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .hero-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .hero-title-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .hero-logo {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .hero-logo {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
    }
  }

  .section--hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
    color: var(--kbm-green-2);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .hero-media {
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .hero-image {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 400px;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .hero-cta {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-note {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #5a6b47;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Full-width intro text below hero grid */
  .hero-intro-text {
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .hero-intro-text p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.1rem);
    color: #5a6b47;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  /* Centered CTA */
  .hero-cta--centered {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .hero-note--full-width {
    max-width: 100%;
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* Section CTA */
  .section-cta {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
  }

  /* Placeholder Images */
  .placeholder-image {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e9ece7 0%, #d4dbc8 100%);
    border: 2px dashed var(--kbm-green-2);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 200px;
  }

  .placeholder-image span {
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .placeholder-image--portrait {
    min-height: 300px;
  }

  /* Buttons */
  .button {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.875rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .button--primary {
    background-color: var(--kbm-green);
    color: #ffffff;
    border-color: var(--kbm-green);
  }

  .button--primary:hover {
    background-color: var(--kbm-green-hover, #445626);
    border-color: var(--kbm-green-hover, #445626);
  }

  .button--secondary {
    background-color: transparent;
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    border-color: var(--kbm-green);
  }

  .button--secondary:hover {
    background-color: var(--kbm-green);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .button--large {
    padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  /* Section Headings */
  .section h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .section h3 {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.8vw, 1.25rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .section p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.1rem);
    color: #5a6b47;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  /* Lists */
  .section ul,
  .section ol {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0;
  }

  .section li {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.05rem);
    color: #5a6b47;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  /* Grid Layout */
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .grid--two {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .grid--two {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  /* Callout Box */
  .callout {
    background: #f9fdf5;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .callout--contrast {
    border-left: 4px solid var(--kbm-green-2);
  }

  .callout p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Steps List */
  .steps-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .steps-list li {
    background: #f9fdf5;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--kbm-green-2);
  }

  .steps-list h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .steps-list p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .steps-list li.kbm-note {
    background: #f2f5ec;
    border-left-color: var(--kbm-green);
  }

  /* Included List */
  .included-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .included-list li {
    padding: 1rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e8e0;
  }

  .included-list li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  /* Pricing Cards */
  .pricing-grid {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .card--pricing {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e5e8e0;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .card--featured {
    border: 2px solid var(--kbm-green);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(82, 104, 45, 0.15);
  }

  .featured-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: var(--kbm-green);
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .card--pricing h3 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .card--pricing .button {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  /* Guarantee Section */
  .section--guarantee {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section--guarantee .section-inner {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .guarantee-note {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* About Section */
  .about-grid {
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-content {
    text-align: left;
  }

  /* Media Elements */
  .media {
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  /* Divider */
  .kbm-divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid #e5e8e0;
    margin: 2rem auto 1.25rem;
  }

  /* Problem Section Styling */
  .section--problem {
    background-color: #F7F9F3;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .fit-icon {
    margin-right: 6px;
    color: #C2614E;
  }

  .section--problem h3 .fa-check {
    color: #6E8B3D;
  }

  /* Overview Cards */
  .workshop-overview-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .workshop-overview-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  .workshop-card {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }

  .workshop-card h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .workshop-card ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .workshop-card li + li {
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }

  /* Final CTA */
  .section--cta {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f9fdf5 0%, #e9ece7 100%);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .section--cta h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section--cta p {
    max-width: 550px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
  }

  .cta-note {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #5a6b47;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Two-column layout */
  .gw-two-col {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .gw-col {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 280px;
  }

  .gw-col h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .gw-two-col {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }

  /* Responsive Adjustments */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page--guided-workshop {
      padding: 1.5rem 1rem 3rem;
    }

    .hero-logo {
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
    }

    .card--pricing {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .section--cta {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .section--overview {
      padding: 1.75rem 1.25rem;
    }
  }

  .pricing-helper {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .pricing-helper a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: #52682d;
  }

  .card--pricing {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .card--pricing ul {
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .card--pricing .button {
    align-self: center;
  }

  .modal-fit-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .modal-fit-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-modal-open="is-this-for-you"]').forEach(el => {
    el.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      const modal = document.getElementById("is-this-for-you-modal");
      if (modal) {
        modal.classList.remove("hidden");
      }
    });
  });

  document.querySelectorAll('[data-modal-close="is-this-for-you"]').forEach(el => {
    el.addEventListener("click", () => {
      const modal = document.getElementById("is-this-for-you-modal");
      if (modal) {
        modal.classList.add("hidden");
      }
    });
  });
</script>
